graph GENERAL_EVIDENCE 1
entry GENERAL-EVIDENCE-001

gate GENERAL-EVIDENCE-001
context HANDOFF
question "Does every claim point to a real readback or reproducible observation rather than a receipt or assertion alone?"
evidence claim_map,readback,observation
YES GENERAL-EVIDENCE-002
NO GENERAL-HARD-STOP
UNKNOWN GENERAL-HARD-STOP
NOT_APPLICABLE GENERAL-HARD-STOP
end

gate GENERAL-EVIDENCE-002
context HANDOFF
question "Do all records name the same source, worktree, session, goal, graph, and environment as the claimed result?"
evidence identity,comparison,digest
YES GENERAL-EVIDENCE-003
NO GENERAL-HARD-STOP
UNKNOWN GENERAL-HARD-STOP
NOT_APPLICABLE GENERAL-HARD-STOP
end

gate GENERAL-EVIDENCE-003
context HANDOFF
question "Was the pass independently checked by host readback or a separate Auditor rather than asserted by the worker alone?"
evidence review,readback,issuer
YES GENERAL-COMPLETE
NO GENERAL-HARD-STOP
UNKNOWN GENERAL-HARD-STOP
NOT_APPLICABLE GENERAL-HARD-STOP
end

terminal GENERAL-COMPLETE COMPLETE "The result evidence is real, matching, and traceable."
terminal GENERAL-HARD-STOP HARD_STOP "A result cannot be accepted without matching evidence."
